classDiagram
  class SurveyState {
    +factor
    +pending
    +notices
    +on_messages()
    +on_result()
    +current_night()
  }
  class Planner {
    +decide()
    +plan()
    +note_action()
    +on_finish()
  }
  class FiberGrid {
    +fiber_center()
    +classify()
  }
  class ScoringModel {
    +quality_model()
    +completion_factor()
    +program_band()
  }
  class LLMClient {
    +ask_json()
  }
  class TraceLog {
    +write()
    +close()
  }
  Planner --> SurveyState : 读取与更新估计
  SurveyState *-- FiberGrid : 公开几何
  SurveyState *-- ScoringModel : 公开评分模型
  Planner --> FiberGrid : 分配候选
  Planner *-- LLMClient : 有预算的建议
  Planner *-- TraceLog : 诊断日志
